Z||000006||mike tatara||09-11-2001||10:27 PM||||im installing a 3800sc and ripped outmy oil<BR>soaked padding and rplaced it with mylar backed heat insulation  58.00 for a 4ftx6ft<BR>roll   from performance improvements in toronto   looks good  works||||reg||1
